  "title": "Zesty Roasted Korean Scamorza Mitbanchan",
  "description": "A roasted, tender, and comforting Korean dish featuring scamorza, boiled to perfection and served as a mitbanchan, with a dairy-free friendly twist, cooked on a comal.",
  "cuisine": "Korean",
