  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the comal to 400 degrees Fahrenheit.",
    "Boil the scamorza cheese in water for 10 minutes.",
    "In a blender, combine gochujang, soy sauce, brown sugar, garlic, and ginger, and blend until smooth.",
    "In a large bowl, whisk together the blended sauce and sesame oil.",
    "Add the boiled scamorza cheese to the bowl and toss to coat.",
    "Place the cheese mixture on the preheated comal and roast for 15 minutes.",
    "Flip the cheese and roast for an additional 10 minutes.",
    "Remove from heat and serve as a mitbanchan."
  ],
